The 12-hour rainfall forecast is Light rains.  
WATERCOURSES NO LONGER TO BE AFFECTED :  

 + **Negros Occidental** - All rivers and its tributaries  
 + **Negros Oriental** - All rivers and its tributaries  
 + **Siquijor** - All rivers and its tributaries  
</description><instruction>With this development and unless significant rain occurs, this is the final general flood advisory for this event.</instruction><web>http://www.pagasa.dost.gov.ph/index.php/26-hydromet/1582-flood-forecast-terms-and-symbols</web><contact>PAGASA-DOST</contact><parameter><valueName>layer:Google:Region:0.1</valueName><value>Region 18 (Negros Island Region)</value></parameter><area><areaDesc>Negros Occidental</areaDesc><polygon>10.901347972718,123.042413106 10.994360400473,123.24046832042 10.920098326828,123.47804188474 10.791740982125,123.56774646545 10.479970230732,123.42358611901 10.386211545776,123.33796764156 10.277243902558,123.19836010127 9.9096582565999,122.98083449812 9.420367040174,122.61544115566 9.6607192461179,122.40813821834 9.8376148642929,122.37600151601 9.9757165924491,122.45304374021 9.9748334861294,122.65343164021 10.120948095053,122.87259934501 10.356207554474,122.86799519553 10.520807936548,122.79609218844 10.672548788065,122.9472383533 10.881098008359,122.95784422618 10.901347972718,123.042413106</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>064500000</value></geocode></area><area><areaDesc>Negros Oriental</areaDesc><polygon>10.386211545776,123.33796764156 10.129487427336,123.2823767267 9.9187565536176,123.16225422233 9.627611376823,123.10952384783 9.3177278959104,123.31563943433 9.2036699782207,123.2852811073 9.0460794757039,123.13058738797 9.0864012672969,122.93461698533 9.3568487705958,122.81576465441 9.420367040174,122.61544115566 9.9096582565999,122.98083449812 10.277243902558,123.19836010127 10.386211545776,123.33796764156</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>074600000</value></geocode></area><area><areaDesc>Siquijor</areaDesc><polygon>9.3003910566625,123.60500160846 9.1299952222022,123.69653238092 9.1009137899053,123.56228986462 9.3003910566625,123.60500160846</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>076100000</value></geocode></area></info><Signature xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/